WEBVTT

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:03.100
The developer sometimes
sells 20 plots a day.

00:00:04.567 --> 00:00:08.107
Right now it's just desert,
but in fact it's gold.

00:00:08.127 --> 00:00:13.127
3-4 years ago the price was
35-37 dirhams per square foot.

00:00:13.147 --> 00:00:17.147
Today it starts from 105
dirhams per square foot.

00:00:18.147 --> 00:00:23.353
Do the math. In fact, a
manufacturer pays back

00:00:23.413 --> 00:00:27.223
their warehouse here in 10-15 years.
- We were told: anything goes.

00:00:27.623 --> 00:00:31.833
- Anything goes. - Yes, anything. But things
can change, you know, it's the Emirates.
